<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/2/eng@/~cl_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Subsection 1(1) of Part I of the Tenth Schedule to the Federal Constitution is amended by substituting for paragraphs (a), (b), (c) and (d) the following paragraphs: “(a) for the first 100,000 persons at the rate of RM102.00 per person; (b) for the next 500,000 persons at the rate of RM14.00 per person; (c) for the next 500,000 persons at the rate of RM13.50 per person; (d) for the remainder at the rate of RM13.00 per person,”."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/2/eng@> .
